        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/836c88e005e998e2ea4378e540a5432b.avif?t=1787344252\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werewolves Revenge is a free <strong>social deduction</strong> game with proximity voice chat, character customization, and hundreds of secret roles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Werewolves meet in secret each night and choose someone to kill. Come sunrise, the Town must work out who's lying before the Werewolves strike again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/ae1690380927361467a59842f682dc46.avif?t=1787344252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras_big/ae1690380927361467a59842f682dc46.webp?t=1787344252 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/fef1dbc3c44aa4c66f6d93e6e74fe62d.webp?t=1787344252\" width=620 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Announce</strong> your thoughts to the Town, or sneak away and plot in <strong>secret</strong>. Words are your greatest weapon but beware, someone is always listening from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/c8ed9e93cc7f277574d69e92d32dd2d9.avif?t=1787344252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras_big/c8ed9e93cc7f277574d69e92d32dd2d9.webp?t=1787344252 width=1560 height=520 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/ed0f616c82d648242ad294bd97c3d042.webp?t=1787344252\" width=770 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match hundreds of items to create something unmistakably yours. If you're gonna be eaten by the Werewolves you might as well look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/3a8074a6e5e30ac0233f33159af220e3.avif?t=1787344252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras_big/3a8074a6e5e30ac0233f33159af220e3.webp?t=1787344252 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/5f4173654c8f710fcf48bc64d6e3b69a.webp?t=1787344252\" width=426 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 400 roles spread across 4 themed sets, each offering a completely unique experience. There's no shortage of ways to murder or deceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/86394a4966e92c3932d2499e874eef05.avif?t=1787344252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras_big/86394a4966e92c3932d2499e874eef05.webp?t=1787344252 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/85f293ee1e11614372471d98f66a0fc0.webp?t=1787344252\" width=604 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock titles and cosmetics by playing and winning as each faction. Show off your achievements and accolades in ways that matter and that can only be earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Also Includes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community-Hosted Games</strong> — Official and Trusted Hosts run public lobbies every day, so there's always a game to join.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Content</strong> — Players can create and share their own custom roles and sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ghost System</strong> — Dying doesn't mean sitting in silence. Ghosts can keep chatting without disturbing the living.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Maps</strong> — From cramped villages to sprawling castles, every map plays differently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curious Critters</strong> — Friendly creatures wander the world, and occasionally witness a crime or two.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotes</strong> — Convey allegiance, distrust, or just sit down and relax.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keywords</strong> — A clear keyword system keeps every ability easy to read.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Titles</strong> — Earn and combine titles to show off your proudest (or most infamous) moments.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/836c88e005e998e2ea4378e540a5432b.avif?t=1787344252\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werewolves Revenge is a free <strong>social deduction</strong> game with proximity voice chat, character customization, and hundreds of secret roles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Werewolves meet in secret each night and choose someone to kill. Come sunrise, the Town must work out who's lying before the Werewolves strike again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/ae1690380927361467a59842f682dc46.avif?t=1787344252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras_big/ae1690380927361467a59842f682dc46.webp?t=1787344252 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/fef1dbc3c44aa4c66f6d93e6e74fe62d.webp?t=1787344252\" width=620 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Announce</strong> your thoughts to the Town, or sneak away and plot in <strong>secret</strong>. Words are your greatest weapon but beware, someone is always listening from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‎ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/c8ed9e93cc7f277574d69e92d32dd2d9.avif?t=1787344252\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras_big/c8ed9e93cc7f277574d69e92d32dd2d9.web